                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ef4f36e0-e379-3735-8af1-436bcee3c914",
                        "entry_id": "f7a8a9f5-b057-3d0e-91a1-1f6cfc260335",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Very severe or strict; draconian."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "dated",
                            "rare"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "59c34579-e021-47f6-a74f-6a4ae74c2b3e",
                                "sense_id": "ef4f36e0-e379-3735-8af1-436bcee3c914",
                                "text": "[…] they no land / Doom'd to bewail the blasphemy of laws / Making kings' rights divine, by some Draconic clause."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fd6c8433-fa21-4eb1-aa27-207466830c51",
                                "sense_id": "ef4f36e0-e379-3735-8af1-436bcee3c914",
                                "text": "The sexual instinct can hardly be changed by prescriptions; I doubt whether all laws against homosexual intercourse, even the most draconic, have ever been able to extinguish the peculiar desire of anybody born with homosexual tendencies."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3420dca1-6577-48aa-9da0-e679aa28a0a7",
                                "sense_id": "ef4f36e0-e379-3735-8af1-436bcee3c914",
                                "text": "In the first months after the October Revolution Lenin was already demanding \"the most decisive, draconic measures to tighten up discipline.\""
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
